 "salvo": "salvo14/mig/s6 (9 Nov 2026), lot k-openai-1 (b-openai + c-openai). Distinguishing among reasoning levels of GPT 5.5 Pro via a grammar lens benchmark. Table 1 (IXG and CSG acceptance, seconds/query), five configurations. Atypical metric: for the authors a higher CSG acceptance is an error (CSG strings should be rejected), so it is not a capability ranking. The route is not named by the paper ('API configuration', 'API default'): the research agent had deduced maker-api from the dated snapshot ids, doubt kept: no route fact written, the ids are written as API ids (namespace maker-api). Total spend about 5,000 USD over the 20,000 queries of the four configurations (pooled, kept as a note fact on every measure).",
